<title>SINGAPORE: Taiwan tenders to buy May jet fuel, closes Apr 1.</title>
<headline>Taiwan tenders to buy May jet fuel, closes Apr 1.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's state-owned Chinese Petroleum Corp (CPC) has issued a tender to buy 32,000 tonnes of jet fuel for May 15-30 delivery, on a cost-and-freight (c-and-f) basis to Keelung or Shen Ao, a CPC source said on Monday.</p>
<p>The tender closes on April 1 and offers will be valid for one day.</p>
<p>In its last tender, CPC bought two 32,000-tonne cargoes of jet fuel at $212.90 and $213.50 per tonne for end April deliveries, c-and-f basis.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3084)</p>
